   The source must be official documentation describing how the token is used in the protocol.
7. usage_evidence (VERY IMPORTANT): One recent, measurable statistic that shows the product is really used, dated between 2026-05-15 and 2026-11-14: for example active nodes or providers, paying customers, monthly transactions, compute hours sold, data or storage served, fees paid by users. Give metric (short English name), value (a plain number exactly as the page shows it, without units), unit and as_of (YYYY-MM-DD). The source must be an official dashboard, block explorer, analytics site or official report that shows this number. null if you find none. Never estimate.
